import Mathlib.Geometry.Manifold.MFDeriv.Atlas
import Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.FiniteDimensional.Basic

/-!
# Tangent spaces of the constructed intrinsic leaves

The differential range of the smooth ambient inclusion is exactly the distribution
straightened by the supplied ambient charts.

AI-assistance disclosure: generated by OpenAI Codex on 2026-10-18.
